{"page":337,"width":1759,"height":2612,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"9.3","words":[{"text":"9.3","x":151,"y":1199,"width":88,"height":36}]},{"text":"9.3 페이징 397","words":[{"text":"9.3","x":1275,"y":144,"width":55,"height":22},{"text":"페이징","x":1347,"y":143,"width":68,"height":26},{"text":"397","x":1489,"y":138,"width":60,"height":28}]},{"text":"만드는 것이다. 그러나 압축이 항상 가능한 것은 아니다. 재배치가 어셈블 또는 적재 시","words":[{"text":"만드는","x":280,"y":272,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":398,"y":272,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":520,"y":272,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"압축이","x":631,"y":272,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"항상","x":738,"y":272,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"가능한","x":813,"y":272,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"것은","x":919,"y":272,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"아니다.","x":992,"y":272,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"재배치가","x":1108,"y":272,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"어셈블","x":1250,"y":271,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"또는","x":1359,"y":272,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"적재","x":1440,"y":270,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"시","x":1519,"y":271,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"에 정적으로 행해진다면, 압축은 실행될 수 없다. 압축은 프로세스들의 재배치가 실행 시","words":[{"text":"에","x":280,"y":331,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"정적으로","x":328,"y":331,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"행해진다면,","x":475,"y":332,"width":169,"height":36},{"text":"압축은","x":659,"y":331,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"실행될","x":765,"y":332,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":866,"y":332,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"없다.","x":911,"y":332,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"압축은","x":991,"y":332,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스들의","x":1095,"y":332,"width":188,"height":36},{"text":"재배치가","x":1299,"y":331,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"실행","x":1441,"y":331,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"시","x":1518,"y":331,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"간에 동적으로 이루어지는 경우에만 가능하다. 주소가 동적으로 재배치할 수 있다면, 재","words":[{"text":"간에","x":280,"y":392,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"동적으로","x":360,"y":391,"wi